#: src/content/docs/troubleshooting/an-update-broke-something.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Four steps to discover what an update changed and to get a functioning system back."
msgstr "Quatter pass per chattar ora tge ch’in’actualisaziun ha midà e per avair puspè in sistem che funcziuna."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: src/content/docs/troubleshooting/an-update-broke-something.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "An update broke something"
msgstr "In’actualisaziun ha donnegià insatge"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: src/content/docs/troubleshooting/an-update-broke-something.md
msgid ""
"**Check whether it is us.** The [build status page](/builds/) shows every "
"package build, including the ones that were held back. If the last run was "
"held back, the repository has not changed since the one before it, and the "
"cause is elsewhere."
msgstr ""
"**Controllar sch’il problem vegn da nus.** La [pagina dal status dals builds]"
"(/builds/) mussa mintga build da pachets, inclus quels ch’èn vegnids "
"retegnids. Sche l’ultima execuziun è vegnida retegnida, n’è il repositori "
"betg sa midà dapi l’execuziun precedenta, e la chaschun sa chatta en in "
"auter lieu."

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: src/content/docs/troubleshooting/an-update-broke-something.md
msgid ""
"**Boot the snapshot.** With automatic snapshots enabled, the pre-update "
"state is a boot menu entry away. This is the fastest way to get a working "
"system back, and it costs nothing to try."
msgstr ""
"**Aviar il snapshot.** Cun ils snapshots automatics activads sa chatta il "
"stadi avant l’actualisaziun directamain en il menu d’aviar. Quai è la via la "
"pli svelta per avair puspè in sistem che funcziuna, ed i na custa nagut da "
"l’empruvar."

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#: src/content/docs/troubleshooting/an-update-broke-something.md
msgid ""
"**Check what actually changed.** `/var/log/pacman.log` lists every upgraded "
"package with a timestamp, so you can narrow the search to what moved."
msgstr ""
"**Controllar tge ch’è sa midà effectivamain.** `/var/log/pacman.log` "
"enumerescha mintga pachet actualisà cun data ed ura, uschia che Vus pudais "
"restrenscher la tschertga a quai ch’è sa midà."

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#: src/content/docs/troubleshooting/an-update-broke-something.md
msgid ""
"**Read the news.** Arch announces every change that needs manual "
"intervention at [archlinux.org/news](https://archlinux.org/news/). If an "
"update needed a step you did not take, it is usually there."
msgstr ""
"**Leger las novitads.** Arch annunzia mintga midada che dovra "
"in’intervenziun manuala sin [archlinux.org/news](https://archlinux.org/"
"news/). Sch’in’actualisaziun ha duvrà in pass che Vus n’avais betg fatg, sa "
"chatta quel per regla là."
